# a copy (HOSTS=SD,localhost, FNPC_BIN a fujinet-pc with the COPY_FILE fix):
# the TNFS host filtered to *Munch*, its file marked, copied into SD/apps
wait 360
press down
press fire
wait 90
type F
wait 40
key *
type 8
key *
type M
type UNCH
key *
type 8
key ENT
wait 90
press right
wait 40
press down
press down
wait 20
type C
wait 60
screen pick
expect pick T0 COPY TO HOST
press up
press fire
wait 60
press fire
wait 60
screen dest
expect dest T0 /apps
expect dest T1 C COPY HERE
type C
wait 180
screen copied
expect copied 2 K.C. Munchki
expect copied 4 COPIED
expectfile SD/apps/K.C. Munchkin (USA).bin
